sequenceDiagram
    actor Retailer as "Retailer"
    actor Admin as "Admin"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant Workflow as "redemptionWorkflow: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    Retailer->>UI: Select reward and request redemption
    UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/loyalty/redemptions
    API->>+Workflow: Create(request, actor)
    Workflow->>DB: Check reward validity, balance and negative-correction block
    alt Sufficient usable points
        Workflow->>DB: Create request and hold/deduct points idempotently
        alt Approval required
            Admin->>UI: Review redemption
            UI->>+API: POST /loyalty/redemptions/{id}/approve
            API->>+Workflow: Approve(id)
            Workflow->>DB: Set Approved
        end
        API-->>-UI: Redemption status
        Admin->>UI: Deliver and complete gift
        UI->>+API: POST .../{id}/deliver then /complete
        API->>+Workflow: Complete(id)
        Workflow->>DB: Append completion ledger and audit
    else Insufficient or negative balance
        Workflow-->>-API: Insufficient points
        API-->>-UI: 409/validation error
    end
    Note over Workflow,DB: Reject/cancel restores held points once; later adjustment/refund posts linked correction.


